Vibhīṣaṇa consoles despairing monkey army --- Hanumān and Vibhīṣaṇa tour torchlit battlefield --- Jāmbavān asks only whether Hanumān lives --- Jāmbavān orders Hanumān to fetch four Himālaya herbs --- Hanumān leaps shaking Laṅkā earth and ocean --- Hanumān seizes whole herb peak when plants hide --- Rāma Lakṣmaṇa smell herbs and rise with monkeys --- Hanumān restores peak to Himālaya